"Y'know, hot stuff...{w}I'm not really a fan of it."{w}{p}"Haaah...{w}I wanna see my sweet Shirinmorin...{w}You know her? Sweet Shirinmorin?"{w}{p}"Sweet Shirinmorin lives deep in Narmant,
and she's all squishy and cool,
and sooo cuuute!"{w}{p}"But I'm the Fire Sage, right?{w}My wings and stuff are kinda on fire, right?{w}Not only won't she see me, she flat-out hates me..."{w}{p}"...Maybe I'll try writing a love letter.{w}Yeah, that might be just the thing.{w}You, wait right there a sec."{w}
